+# Full-Menu Beta 0.2.0 Release Report
+
+Status: Incomplete. Not release-ready and not Accepted.
+Assessment date: 2026-09-05.
+
+## Delivery Position
+
+FMB-T001 through FMB-T006 have local implementation/review evidence and remain
+Needs_Review for founder acceptance. FMB-T007 is an incomplete integration task.
+The third three-hour sprint produced an unconnected execution core, not a usable
+end-to-end read-only query feature. Existing local preview health does not prove T007.
+
+The current T007 source includes a typed aggregate compiler, plan provenance/digest
+extensions, application/repository/adapter skeletons, credential opt-in and migration21.
+Only narrow compiler/unit and compilation checks are established. Execution application
+and adapter packages have no dedicated tests. The implementation worker stopped after
+an execution-quota error and supplied a frozen handoff in the final verification window.
+
+## Release Blockers
+
+1. Normal governed publication must compose a usable release from immutable published
+   pins without copying mutable drafts or backfilling historical physical provenance.
+2. Formal JoinContract references must drive validated typed joins; current joins fail
+   closed and the supported multi-relation journey is incomplete.
+3. REST, MCP, CLI, TypeScript SDK, Ask, configuration and the application composition
+   root must connect to the same bounded execution service.
+4. Real PostgreSQL tests must prove least privilege, source identity, current authority,
+   limits, cancellation, concurrency, process loss and no retained sensitive results.
+5. Populated migration21 lifecycle, readiness21, full regression and desktop journeys
+   must pass against the integrated candidate.
+6. Production builds must exclude UAT identities. Release provenance and SBOM must bind
+   the actual source and both Go and embedded-Web dependencies.
+7. Hosted HTTPS/OIDC/provider/source/webhook/OTel/recovery proof requires an approved
+   environment. Local fixtures cannot substitute for these gates.
+
+## Runtime And Handoff
+
+The existing local development preview remains healthy at `http://127.0.0.1:18081`.
+It is the earlier migration20 preview, not a deployment of this T007 source. Do not
+rebuild or upgrade it as a Beta candidate until migration/readiness integration passes.
+No commit, push, external deployment or destructive volume operation is performed.
+
+Current evidence:
+
+- `docs/evidence/FMB-T007/implementation-handoff.md`: exact source ownership and gaps.
+- `docs/evidence/FMB-T007/review.md`: independent findings and closure status.
+- `docs/evidence/FMB-T007/test-results.md`: authoritative final command outcomes.
+- `docs/evidence/FMB-T007/hosted-matrix.md`: external acceptance gaps.
+- `docs/evidence/FMB-T007/menu-truthfulness.md`: production/local-fixture boundaries.
+
+Full-Menu Beta and the three-hour implementation objective are not reported complete.
+Further implementation needs a resumed execution window; founder acceptance is separate.
